OL,5,G2230 Inferno at Sea: The Deepwater
OL,6,G     Disaster
OL,7,     FOn a spring evening in April 2010,
OL,8,     F126 workers on the Deepwater
OL,9,     FHorizon rig were drilling for oil
OL,10,     Fin the Gulf of Mexico, when
OL,11,     Fsuddenly the ground beneath their
OL,12,     Ffeet starts to shake.
OL,13,G0000 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,14,     FMartha accidentally confesses to
OL,15,     FErica that she murdered Bella. In
OL,16,     FSolitary, Martha jumps Vera and
OL,17,     Fputs a fork to her throat,
OL,18,     Fdragging her on to the roof.
